## What to deliver

Build the icon set up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png`
matches the brief: eight small, mutually-distinguishable item icons — the three
plates, the two ores, the stone, the gear wheel, and the circuit board — each
centred in its own 16×16 frame with a consistent dark outline and top-left
lighting. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are
your finished submission.
